        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/a54c3b8b732a9981a94505dc6b3739b5.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/a54c3b8b732a9981a94505dc6b3739b5.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/a54c3b8b732a9981a94505dc6b3739b5.mp4?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Drowned Deal</strong></u><strong> is a roguelike deck-building card game inspired by poker.  Buy cursed coins to enhance poker combo points, survive varied penalties each round, and face deadly pirate cards on the high seas.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=435 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Cursed Coins:</strong></u> Discover 45 unique cursed coins, each with its own special ability. Strengthen your hand, unlock powerful synergies, and uncover hidden effects that can change the course of every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/1456b0a29caed5b3b03e1f75f421a92a.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=488 height=379 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/1456b0a29caed5b3b03e1f75f421a92a.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=435 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Powerful Hands:</strong></u> Build a variety of strong poker-inspired hands, each carrying its own base damage value. Strive to create the ultimate hand and unleash the most powerful combination of all — <i>The Drowned Deal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/dfef7cca7b0fc9d7c181681d904e57fa.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/dfef7cca7b0fc9d7c181681d904e57fa.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/dfef7cca7b0fc9d7c181681d904e57fa.mp4?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=435 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Penalty System:</strong> Face more than 15 unique penalties that can change with every run. Each pirate encounter may impose a new challenge, making your mission to capture them even harder—so be careful how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/43d62d73f88d743c7cdaf27d59c6b9be.avif?t=1759433549\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/a54c3b8b732a9981a94505dc6b3739b5.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/a54c3b8b732a9981a94505dc6b3739b5.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/a54c3b8b732a9981a94505dc6b3739b5.mp4?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Drowned Deal</strong></u><strong> is a roguelike deck-building card game inspired by poker.  Buy cursed coins to enhance poker combo points, survive varied penalties each round, and face deadly pirate cards on the high seas.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.poster.avif?t=1759433549\" width=435 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963830/extras/5fc0cfbecf696417578e2d669f007094.webm?t=1759433549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Cursed Coins:</strong></u> Discover 45 unique cursed coins, each with its own special ability. Strengthen your hand, unlock powerful synergies, and uncover hidden effects that can change the course of every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl